or:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mongo.is.connected</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mongo</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">==</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n    productTitle </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> mongo.distinct</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mongo</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;mydb.Arts&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;product/title&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">for</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">i </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">in</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">length</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">productTitle</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)){</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">if</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">output</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">names </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">==</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> productTitle</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">i</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">])</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n      paste</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">productTitle</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">i</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">])</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">}}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\">#output$choice &lt;- renderText({input$names})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">})</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both\">Doing so I&#39;m facing a problem. The big data consists of several collections and each connection has many documents associated with it. &quot;mydb.Arts&quot;, &quot;mydb.IndustrialandScientific&quot; and &quot;mydb.Jewelry&quot; are three such collections. We are giving the user the choice to select the collection and upon his/her first selection we use the rederUI function to output the second select menu. Now, this secong menu consists of about 4000 product names that we have queried out from mongo. My question is how do I use the user&#39;s selection of Product Name which is reactive to query mongo. Is it possible to declare a global variable feed the user&#39;s choice into that variable and then use it to query mongo outside the reactive functions? Please guide me as to how to solve this problem.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both\">Basically we want to use the value selected in (code from server.r)</p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;font-size:13px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">output</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">names </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">({</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n selectInput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;names&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;Select Product&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> choices </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> var</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">())</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">})</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both\">and just display on main panel by doing below(code from server.r)</p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;font-size:13px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Co